# L §5.5 Fan-out (tally 2.1.7 R8, issue #147; #122c, P48 kept): the twin of L5_5_fanout_guarded_leg: charge
# books at konto (accounts, no sign rule) and the world, so its flows read no axis and print no head, though
# salary's amount reads pa. Passes on 2.1.6's refcore too: it pins the rule's boundary. (T's G7 fl.)
=== fl.tally
model fl
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-25
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "made up"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

axis pa
  lo "lower pay"
  hi "higher pay"

place konto: accounts DUK lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input p_lo: money DUK

input p_hi: money DUK

input d1: date

input fee: money DUK

def pay: money DUK at d1
  rule base = p_lo
  rule hi beats base = p_hi when pa == hi

move salary: transfers
  on d1
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay

move charge: transfers
  on d1
  leg cash from konto to world amount fee

ask q_fc: flows(charge, 2026-03-01) law 2026-10-25

ask q_fs: flows(salary, 2026-03-01) law 2026-10-25

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  p_lo = 1000.00
  p_hi = 1200.00
  d1 = 2026-03-01
  fee = 10.00
=== expect
q_fc: 10.00 DUK
  unfulfilled: charge
  law date 2026-10-25, cut 2026-10-25
q_fs [pa = lo]: 1 000.00 DUK
  reading: pa = lo
  unfulfilled: salary
  law date 2026-10-25, cut 2026-10-25
q_fs [pa = hi]: 1 200.00 DUK
  reading: pa = hi
  unfulfilled: salary
  law date 2026-10-25, cut 2026-10-25
